            <li><a href="/ranking/overall/" class="text-slate-700 hover:text-blue-600 block py-1 font-semibold">2026 年度综合总榜 →</a></li>
            <li><a href="/ranking/value/" class="text-slate-700 hover:text-blue-600 block py-1 font-semibold">每GB单价性价比榜 →</a></li>
            <li><a href="/ranking/stable/" class="text-slate-700 hover:text-blue-600 block py-1 font-semibold">晚高峰稳定性排行榜 →</a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
